WEBVTT

01:30.270 --> 01:34.860
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.220 --> 01:37.660
[Episode 20]

01:39.070 --> 01:41.600
After extensive inquiries,
the Feiyu Guards

01:41.840 --> 01:44.640
have obtained the spring water
from Mount Tianyu.

01:45.710 --> 01:48.509
His Majesty is currently taking it
to recuperate.

01:48.590 --> 01:51.490
He has no time to care about your excuses.

01:51.560 --> 01:53.800
The Kunlun Mirror is not yet complete.

01:53.870 --> 01:56.670
How could you have obtained
the Yuli Spring water?

02:00.680 --> 02:03.480
You dare to present fake spring water
as a tribute?

02:04.040 --> 02:04.820
Ji Yan,

02:04.920 --> 02:06.650
you are deceiving His Majesty!

02:07.400 --> 02:09.310
Deceiving me?

02:10.680 --> 02:14.000
It seems to me the one deceiving me
is you, Bingzhu.

02:14.000 --> 02:14.800
Your Majesty!

02:18.710 --> 02:20.850
Do you recognize this person?

02:21.680 --> 02:22.560
Of course we do.

02:23.079 --> 02:23.910
Your Majesty,

02:24.360 --> 02:25.240
the one who harmed us

02:25.240 --> 02:26.440
is this man, Bingzhu.

02:26.590 --> 02:27.840
On the celestial mountain,

02:27.840 --> 02:29.650
we served the immortals
with all our hearts,

02:29.650 --> 02:32.579
and only then did they
grant us the Yuli Spring water.

02:32.910 --> 02:34.800
But to our surprise, he actually planned
to keep it for himself

02:34.800 --> 02:36.280
and even tried to silence us.

02:36.280 --> 02:37.240
What nonsense are you talking about?

02:37.240 --> 02:38.710
We escaped through countless hardships,

02:38.710 --> 02:40.030
all to see Your Majesty

02:40.030 --> 02:42.290
and seek justice for our fallen sisters.

02:42.520 --> 02:43.320
Your Majesty,

02:44.079 --> 02:45.630
they are clearly framing me!

02:45.630 --> 02:47.560
I beg Your Majesty
to see through this deceit!

02:47.560 --> 02:48.890
For thousands of years,

02:49.150 --> 02:51.680
our ancestors endured countless hardships,

02:52.430 --> 02:54.520
and yet the first to drink
the Yuli Spring water

02:54.520 --> 02:57.870
turns out to be you rat.

03:01.560 --> 03:04.000
At 3 quarters past noon tomorrow,
outside the Meridian Gate,

03:04.000 --> 03:05.590
Bingzhu will be executed.

03:06.210 --> 03:07.210
At that time,

03:07.470 --> 03:09.800
I'll bring all court officials to witness

03:10.430 --> 03:13.750
just how effective
the Yuli Spring truly is.

04:48.560 --> 04:49.760
Hong Ye, look at this!

04:52.680 --> 04:54.540
Miss, you have excellent taste.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.920
You're already so beautiful, Miss,

04:57.000 --> 04:58.360
and with my lantern,

04:58.510 --> 05:00.590
you'd truly be one of a kind.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.130
Well, I'm just looking.

05:04.870 --> 05:07.070
How much silver for this lantern, Boss?

05:07.310 --> 05:08.160
Six coins.

05:08.920 --> 05:09.430
Sir.

05:09.680 --> 05:11.070
It's the Lantern Festival today.

05:11.070 --> 05:12.430
Now that you're out with your sweetheart,

05:12.430 --> 05:14.230
be generous with your spending.

05:15.070 --> 05:16.160
We don't want it.

05:16.160 --> 05:17.890
Hong Ye, let's look elsewhere.

05:18.920 --> 05:19.850
Please don't go!

05:21.160 --> 05:23.490
Wish-Fulfilling Rings!

05:23.920 --> 05:25.830
If you land a ring,
get the prize for free!

05:25.830 --> 05:28.360
If you miss, it's one tael of silver
for 10 rings.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.830
First come, first served!

05:29.830 --> 05:31.160
It's all about luck!

05:32.750 --> 05:33.240
You two.

05:33.720 --> 05:34.310
Want to try it out?

05:34.310 --> 05:35.640
It's wish-fulfilling.

05:36.000 --> 05:36.750
Give me 5 rings.

05:36.750 --> 05:37.409
Sure thing!

05:37.920 --> 05:38.560
Xiao Yao,

05:38.720 --> 05:40.320
we don't have any money on us.

05:40.750 --> 05:42.880
Don't worry. We're here to make money.

05:43.200 --> 05:44.400
Come on, you go first.

05:46.200 --> 05:46.940
Which one?

05:47.430 --> 05:49.340
Whichever you like.

05:49.870 --> 05:51.470
Let's watch them play first.

05:54.000 --> 05:54.630
He landed it!

05:54.630 --> 05:55.159
He landed it!

05:55.159 --> 05:55.950
He won!

05:56.240 --> 05:57.720
You're so good!

05:57.820 --> 05:58.510
Try again.

06:04.920 --> 06:07.320
-Sir, you're really lucky.
-Again. Again.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.210
He landed another one!

06:14.270 --> 06:15.600
Go for the silver ingot.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.180
You won!

06:28.560 --> 06:29.310
Great!

06:30.440 --> 06:31.900
How can you call that a win?

06:32.270 --> 06:33.880
Why isn't that a win?

06:33.950 --> 06:34.950
Yeah, why doesn't it count?

06:34.950 --> 06:36.070
For the game of ring toss,

06:36.070 --> 06:38.159
you have to land the ring in the center
to win.

06:38.159 --> 06:39.510
But you didn't mention

06:39.510 --> 06:40.840
this rule earlier.

06:41.000 --> 06:42.800
Boss, you can't cheat like this.

06:43.040 --> 06:43.830
Miss,

06:43.830 --> 06:45.350
that's quite offensive.

06:45.560 --> 06:47.120
How can you call this cheating?

06:47.120 --> 06:47.870
I did say

06:47.890 --> 06:49.920
I won't charge a penny
if you land the ring.

06:49.920 --> 06:52.460
But shouldn't you follow some basic rules?

06:52.800 --> 06:54.190
If everyone were like you, sir,

06:54.190 --> 06:55.190
casually throwing rings

06:55.190 --> 06:56.560
and counting near misses as wins,

06:56.560 --> 06:58.000
wouldn't I become

06:58.120 --> 06:59.920
some fool who loses all his money?

06:59.920 --> 07:00.580
Fine, fine.

07:00.950 --> 07:02.350
We'll follow your rules.

07:06.720 --> 07:07.360
He landed it!

07:07.360 --> 07:08.310
This must count now, right?

07:08.310 --> 07:09.770
-That's right.
-Exactly.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.120
What do you have to say now?

07:11.120 --> 07:11.560
Exactly.

07:11.560 --> 07:12.630
This must count now, right?

07:12.630 --> 07:13.290
Indeed.

07:14.650 --> 07:15.850
Still doesn't count.

07:16.280 --> 07:17.480
Why doesn't it count?

07:17.630 --> 07:19.270
It clearly landed according to your rules.

07:19.270 --> 07:20.750
You were the one throwing rings before,

07:20.750 --> 07:22.240
and now, suddenly this lady
is throwing them.

07:22.240 --> 07:23.640
What's the logic in that?

07:24.040 --> 07:24.870
So what?

07:24.870 --> 07:26.200
We're a family.

07:26.720 --> 07:28.420
Just because you claim you're a family,
that makes it so?

07:28.420 --> 07:30.240
What if these two say they're a family

07:30.240 --> 07:31.050
and want to play as one team,

07:31.050 --> 07:32.630
and those 5 also want to form a team?

07:32.630 --> 07:33.940
How am I supposed to run my business then?

07:33.940 --> 07:34.880
Alright, fine.

07:35.159 --> 07:36.480
Today, I'll see it to the very end.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.610
Give me 5 more rings.

07:38.680 --> 07:39.140
Come on.

07:39.360 --> 07:39.820
Come on,

07:40.310 --> 07:41.120
give us 5 more rings.

07:41.120 --> 07:41.600
Sure,

07:44.630 --> 07:47.210
but pay for these 10 rings first.

07:53.480 --> 07:54.190
Why?

07:54.270 --> 07:56.890
We'll pay for it altogether
after this round.

07:57.800 --> 07:59.210
Seems like you two

07:59.510 --> 08:00.710
don't have any money.

08:02.070 --> 08:03.600
I could tell from the start.

08:04.050 --> 08:05.510
Since you've got no money,

08:05.670 --> 08:08.160
-I'll stop him. You go first.
-you wanted to use

08:08.160 --> 08:09.310
some underhanded tricks...

08:09.310 --> 08:09.800
No need.

08:09.800 --> 08:11.270
To scam me out of my money.

08:12.750 --> 08:13.840
Everyone here,

08:13.920 --> 08:15.180
you're all witnesses.

08:15.240 --> 08:17.510
I'm just trying to
run an honest business here.

08:17.510 --> 08:19.520
I've seen many people like this before.

08:19.520 --> 08:20.630
I can spot people like them

08:20.630 --> 08:22.160
at a glance.

08:22.190 --> 08:23.680
In a moment, just do

08:23.680 --> 08:25.080
whatever I tell you to do.

08:25.510 --> 08:26.310
Let me tell you,

08:26.310 --> 08:27.240
you're not leaving today.

08:27.240 --> 08:28.700
Either pay up properly,

08:28.750 --> 08:29.400
or

08:29.510 --> 08:30.880
hand over all those

08:30.950 --> 08:33.429
tricks and gadgets you're hiding.

08:33.630 --> 08:34.390
Otherwise,

08:35.720 --> 08:37.580
don't blame me for getting rough.

08:37.720 --> 08:38.960
Everyone, look!

08:38.960 --> 08:40.150
This man is making dirty money

08:40.150 --> 08:41.440
and falsely accusing innocent people!

08:41.440 --> 08:43.240
Is there no justice anymore?

08:43.240 --> 08:43.909
Exactly.

08:44.080 --> 08:45.000
-I'll let you know...
-Fall!

08:45.000 --> 08:46.130
What justice means!

08:46.960 --> 08:47.640
Honey.

08:48.000 --> 08:48.840
Honey!

08:49.600 --> 08:51.480
Honey, what's wrong?

08:51.630 --> 08:52.000
Stop pretending.

08:52.000 --> 08:53.320
How could you hit him?

08:53.630 --> 08:54.630
This is extortion!

08:54.630 --> 08:55.840
I didn't touch him at all!

08:55.840 --> 08:56.720
I... You all saw it!

08:56.720 --> 08:57.790
I truly didn't touch him!

08:57.790 --> 08:58.960
You were already sick...

08:58.960 --> 08:59.720
He fell down by himself!

08:59.720 --> 09:00.750
Close your eyes.

09:00.750 --> 09:01.630
You all saw it!

09:01.630 --> 09:03.320
What am I supposed to do from here on out?

09:03.320 --> 09:04.740
-I didn't touch him at all!
-What's going on here?

09:04.740 --> 09:05.390
What happened?

09:05.390 --> 09:06.240
I didn't touch him.

09:06.240 --> 09:07.170
What's going on?

09:08.010 --> 09:08.980
Officer!

09:09.480 --> 09:10.010
It's him!

09:10.240 --> 09:11.440
He's running a dishonest business!

09:11.440 --> 09:12.390
He set us up

09:12.390 --> 09:14.510
and punched my husband.

09:14.510 --> 09:16.440
My husband was already ill.

09:16.440 --> 09:17.270
Now

09:17.270 --> 09:18.550
he's not going to survive.

09:18.550 --> 09:21.440
What should I do after he's gone?

09:21.720 --> 09:23.840
Please seek justice for me, Officer!

09:23.840 --> 09:25.120
It's not like that, Your Honor!

09:25.120 --> 09:26.960
D-Don't listen to
this wicked woman's lies!

09:26.960 --> 09:28.150
I didn't touch him at all!

09:28.150 --> 09:29.390
I might have bumped him slightly
with my elbow,

09:29.390 --> 09:30.630
-but I didn’t…
-You call that "bumping him slightly"?

09:30.630 --> 09:31.600
You punched him so hard

09:31.600 --> 09:34.150
-that he's still unconscious even now!
-I didn't. I…

09:34.150 --> 09:36.210
Please seek justice for us, Officer!

09:37.600 --> 09:38.480
Officer!

09:43.140 --> 09:45.270
Why did you play along so well just now?

09:46.370 --> 09:47.770
You said we were a family.

09:47.810 --> 09:48.960
If I hadn't gone along with it,

09:48.960 --> 09:51.760
wouldn't that have put you
in an awkward position?

09:53.690 --> 09:55.000
Let's go eat. Come on.

09:56.660 --> 09:58.440
[Jinzun Restaurant]

09:58.270 --> 09:59.030
These are your orders, right?

09:59.030 --> 10:00.030
Please sit and wait for a while.

10:00.030 --> 10:00.550
Please.

10:03.690 --> 10:04.290
I want

10:04.320 --> 10:05.720
this, this,

10:05.790 --> 10:06.910
this, and this.

10:05.810 --> 10:07.870
[Wolfberry Lamb Stew]
[Eucommia Bark & Codonopsis Pigeon Soup]

10:07.240 --> 10:08.640
And a pot of good wine too.

10:09.030 --> 10:10.080
Xiao Dadan said

10:10.080 --> 10:11.880
these are all excellent tonics.

10:11.910 --> 10:13.390
Your body has just suffered
a serious injury.

10:13.390 --> 10:16.790
You need to eat more of these
to nourish yourself and recover.

10:18.120 --> 10:18.920
What's wrong?

10:19.360 --> 10:19.870
No problem, no problem.

10:19.870 --> 10:22.240
Please sit and wait for a while,
honored guests.

10:22.240 --> 10:23.360
Two honored guests!

10:23.360 --> 10:24.390
Wolfberry Lamb Stew,

10:24.390 --> 10:26.000
Eucommia Bark & Codonopsis Pigeon Soup,

10:26.000 --> 10:27.240
Premium Yam,

10:27.240 --> 10:28.080
and a pot of Blossoms and Full Moon Wine

10:28.080 --> 10:31.620
infused with oysters and kudzu root!

10:31.790 --> 10:33.790
Why are they looking at me like that?

10:37.360 --> 10:38.820
Because you're handsome.

10:39.670 --> 10:41.750
This young lady really knows
how to order for her husband.

10:41.750 --> 10:43.880
Those dishes are all very nourishing.

10:45.790 --> 10:47.120
Please enjoy your meal.

10:52.550 --> 10:53.750
Have some soup.

11:03.080 --> 11:03.670
Eat more.

11:06.030 --> 11:06.600
Come on, eat up.

11:06.600 --> 11:08.910
After we finish eating,
we'll find an inn to rest for a while.

11:08.910 --> 11:09.630
Xiao Yao.

11:10.910 --> 11:11.510
I...

11:12.200 --> 11:14.320
I'm not used to this food.

11:15.390 --> 11:16.850
I'll wait for you outside.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.150
Not used to it?

11:22.910 --> 11:24.570
Why didn't you say so earlier?

11:30.000 --> 11:30.910
It's not bad.

11:31.080 --> 11:32.610
Yes, and it smells good too.

11:36.000 --> 11:38.360
This young gentleman has such rosy cheeks.

11:38.360 --> 11:40.420
Is it because he also used your rouge?

11:44.000 --> 11:45.560
Yes, he used our rouge.

11:48.030 --> 11:49.080
No wonder!

11:49.200 --> 11:50.860
His skin is amazing too.

11:51.790 --> 11:53.200
Miss, please restrain yourself.

11:53.200 --> 11:54.870
It's even more flawless and delicate

11:54.870 --> 11:56.280
than that of an ordinary young girl.

11:56.280 --> 11:57.910
What do you normally use
to wash your face, sir?

11:57.910 --> 11:59.480
-Do you have any secret methods?
-So nice.

11:59.480 --> 12:01.630
Of course it's because
our rouge is excellent.

12:01.630 --> 12:02.360
When did I ever...

12:02.360 --> 12:03.150
Really?

12:03.960 --> 12:05.200
All from your shop?

12:05.200 --> 12:06.300
All your products?

12:06.550 --> 12:08.680
I don't really have any secret method.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.510
But I often select the best rouge

12:10.510 --> 12:12.010
for my wife at home,

12:12.080 --> 12:14.510
and I happened to try
their rouge and face powder.

12:14.510 --> 12:15.750
Which one did you use?

12:15.750 --> 12:16.240
Right.

12:16.270 --> 12:16.870
Tell us.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.150
I used...

12:21.630 --> 12:22.220
Boss.

12:22.630 --> 12:24.760
Here comes our business opportunity.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.120
20-80.

12:28.750 --> 12:30.470
50-50. I can't do more.

12:31.240 --> 12:31.840
10-90.

12:31.950 --> 12:32.600
Boss,

12:32.790 --> 12:34.240
which one did he actually use?

12:34.240 --> 12:35.840
Yes, which one exactly?

12:35.840 --> 12:36.440
Fine.

12:36.440 --> 12:38.080
-Which one?
-Which one?

12:38.080 --> 12:39.410
The one you're holding,

12:39.630 --> 12:41.090
this one, and this one too.

12:41.120 --> 12:41.870
Yes. That's right.

12:41.870 --> 12:42.870
It's this one.

12:42.870 --> 12:43.790
This one makes your skin look fair.

12:43.790 --> 12:45.190
I'll take this one, Boss.

12:46.080 --> 12:47.370
He used this one too?

13:02.600 --> 13:04.190
Where have you been?

13:04.320 --> 13:06.240
I didn't see you when I came out
after I finished eating.

13:06.240 --> 13:07.240
I was so worried.

13:07.240 --> 13:08.750
I looked everywhere for you.

13:08.750 --> 13:10.750
You just left me there all alone?

13:12.320 --> 13:13.080
I...

13:15.080 --> 13:16.610
What are you smiling about?

13:22.910 --> 13:23.440
This...

13:25.510 --> 13:26.770
Did you steal this?

13:26.790 --> 13:27.630
I earned it.

13:43.870 --> 13:44.840
I didn't expect

13:45.080 --> 13:47.480
you to use your looks to earn money,
My Lord.

13:48.920 --> 13:50.710
How is that "using my looks"?

13:50.840 --> 13:52.740
In the martial world,
everyone relies on their own skills.

13:52.740 --> 13:54.140
That was your own saying.

13:55.550 --> 13:56.680
You're catching on.

13:57.170 --> 13:59.370
One takes on the color of one's company.

14:00.250 --> 14:01.980
Why don't we release a lantern?

14:02.510 --> 14:03.570
Release a lantern?

14:03.790 --> 14:04.590
You mean this?

14:04.720 --> 14:06.050
This can't be released.

14:06.750 --> 14:07.610
I mean this one.

14:10.270 --> 14:11.150
A sky lantern?

14:12.150 --> 14:12.550
Yes.

14:13.310 --> 14:15.150
You can make a wish with a sky lantern.

14:15.150 --> 14:16.510
When it reaches a certain height,

14:16.510 --> 14:17.630
you say your wish out loud,

14:17.630 --> 14:18.830
and it will come true.

14:19.790 --> 14:20.990
Shall we give it a try?

14:43.580 --> 14:45.500
I hope Hong Ye

14:46.270 --> 14:48.330
can restore his spiritual power soon

14:48.910 --> 14:51.520
and won't get hurt ever again.

14:55.150 --> 14:56.260
I wish time

14:57.530 --> 14:59.260
would pause for a moment for me.

15:03.680 --> 15:06.200
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

15:08.030 --> 15:10.640
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

15:12.100 --> 15:14.890
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

15:16.320 --> 15:19.050
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

15:20.760 --> 15:23.530
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

15:25.070 --> 15:27.790
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

15:29.310 --> 15:31.990
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

15:33.430 --> 15:36.050
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

15:39.600 --> 15:42.450
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

15:43.810 --> 15:46.780
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

15:48.160 --> 15:51.010
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

15:52.230 --> 15:55.140
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

15:56.640 --> 15:59.930
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

16:01.130 --> 16:04.350
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

16:05.710 --> 16:08.590
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

16:09.690 --> 16:12.760
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

16:13.750 --> 16:16.390
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

16:17.400 --> 16:20.460
♪ I brew years of romance
and longing into wine ♪

16:21.720 --> 16:25.600
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

16:26.650 --> 16:29.410
♪ Eternal sorrows end, the broken cocoon
becomes an ark ♪

16:30.530 --> 16:33.540
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

16:34.380 --> 16:37.610
♪ I boil away my worries
with dew and strands of hair ♪

16:38.530 --> 16:42.790
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

16:43.800 --> 16:47.460
♪ Three lives of joy,
growing old with one heart ♪

16:50.630 --> 16:51.530
It came true!

16:51.670 --> 16:53.550
Your power's been restored, right?

16:53.550 --> 16:55.300
You've got your power back, right?

16:55.300 --> 16:56.750
You were over there just now,

16:56.750 --> 16:58.480
and now you've moved over here.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.390
Not really.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.390
If lighting a lantern

17:01.390 --> 17:02.840
could make wishes come true,

17:02.840 --> 17:04.960
then the world wouldn't need
Yuli Spring anymore.

17:04.960 --> 17:06.490
So it hasn't been restored.

17:08.240 --> 17:09.770
What wish did you just make?

17:13.790 --> 17:14.550
I forgot.

17:14.720 --> 17:15.380
You forgot?

17:16.790 --> 17:17.480
You're lying.

17:17.480 --> 17:18.940
Are you plotting something?

17:18.940 --> 17:19.670
Of course...

17:21.160 --> 17:22.000
Of course not.

17:22.069 --> 17:24.480
Hong Ye, you've learned to be naughty now.

17:24.550 --> 17:25.790
Are you plotting something?

17:25.790 --> 17:26.550
What wish did you make?

17:26.550 --> 17:27.069
I'm not.

17:27.069 --> 17:27.829
Tell me.

17:27.829 --> 17:28.790
-I'm really not.
-You are!

17:28.790 --> 17:29.200
Stop asking.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.150
You can't hide it from me.

17:30.150 --> 17:32.320
[Qingfeng Inn]

17:33.310 --> 17:34.960
Boss, two rooms please.

17:36.000 --> 17:38.030
No rooms available. We're fully booked.

17:38.030 --> 17:39.890
Why is this inn also fully booked?

17:40.110 --> 17:41.480
Today is the Lantern Festival.

17:41.480 --> 17:42.880
Young couples coming for the lantern show

17:42.880 --> 17:44.360
have all booked the rooms in advance.

17:44.360 --> 17:46.020
There are no vacancies at all.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.490
There is! We have a room!

17:49.590 --> 17:51.030
You two are so lucky.

17:51.160 --> 17:52.510
A young couple

17:52.510 --> 17:53.480
just had a fight

17:53.480 --> 17:54.790
and canceled their room.

17:54.790 --> 17:56.650
So we have one room available now.

17:57.110 --> 17:58.920
But we need two rooms.

18:00.000 --> 18:03.000
What kind of married couple
sleeps in separate rooms?

18:03.200 --> 18:03.720
I...

18:03.960 --> 18:04.750
We...

18:05.000 --> 18:05.730
We're not...

18:09.680 --> 18:10.640
Having a tiff?

18:13.240 --> 18:13.750
Yeah.

18:14.790 --> 18:15.790
Couples are all like this,

18:15.790 --> 18:17.590
fighting at dusk but making up by dawn.

18:17.590 --> 18:19.750
By morning, they'll definitely be fine,

18:19.750 --> 18:20.200
right?

18:20.550 --> 18:21.350
That's right.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.750
So, do you want it or not?

18:33.790 --> 18:34.960
Yes, we'll take it.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.110
Great. Come on then.

18:36.110 --> 18:37.310
Alright, excellent.

18:37.750 --> 18:38.410
Come along.

18:53.150 --> 18:55.840
It's not like we haven't
shared a room before.

18:56.880 --> 18:57.810
You take the bed,

18:57.830 --> 18:59.360
and I'll sleep on the floor.

19:06.550 --> 19:07.960
You take the bed.

19:08.400 --> 19:09.260
I'll meditate.

19:10.880 --> 19:12.550
You're a mortal now.

19:12.680 --> 19:14.340
Staying up late isn't good for
your health.

19:14.340 --> 19:15.340
Alright, come on.

19:15.640 --> 19:18.240
I'm still a bit hungry.
I didn't have my fill earlier.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.240
I'll go have some late-night snacks

19:19.240 --> 19:20.240
and be right back.

19:20.400 --> 19:22.860
I'll bring you something tasty
if I find any.

19:37.270 --> 19:38.720
I hope by the time I get back,

19:38.720 --> 19:40.320
he'll be asleep.

19:42.510 --> 19:45.370
But how could he possibly sleep
while I'm out alone?

19:48.440 --> 19:49.040
Forget it.

19:53.270 --> 19:54.310
I'll take this one. And this one.

19:54.310 --> 19:55.940
Two of these, please.

19:56.070 --> 19:58.870
-Alright.
-Today, we captured a boar demon

19:59.000 --> 20:01.070
and are delivering it
to the magistrate's office

20:01.070 --> 20:02.930
to eliminate this evil creature.

20:04.640 --> 20:06.830
This evil demon
has harmed countless people.

20:06.830 --> 20:08.000
At daybreak tomorrow,

20:08.000 --> 20:10.350
it'll be skinned alive
and have its tendons pulled,

20:10.350 --> 20:13.880
its flesh cut and bones stripped,
then braised and deep-fried.

20:15.720 --> 20:19.530
Flesh cut and bones stripped,
then braised and deep-fried.

20:20.510 --> 20:24.160
Flesh cut and bones stripped,
then braised and deep-fried.

20:24.310 --> 20:26.310
This evil demon has harmed
countless people.

20:26.310 --> 20:27.680
At daybreak tomorrow,

20:27.790 --> 20:30.240
it'll be skinned alive
and have its tendons pulled,

20:30.240 --> 20:33.770
its flesh cut and bones stripped,
then braised and deep-fried.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.550
Flesh cut and bones stripped...

20:36.550 --> 20:37.000
Luoluo!

20:37.000 --> 20:38.660
Then braised and deep-fried.

20:41.110 --> 20:43.110
Great News on the Lantern Festival:

20:43.270 --> 20:44.540
Today, we captured

20:44.680 --> 20:46.680
a boar demon...

20:56.070 --> 20:56.590
Bro.

20:57.000 --> 20:58.060
Don't eat too much.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.720
We'll slaughter the pig tomorrow,
remember?

21:00.720 --> 21:01.160
Right.

21:01.160 --> 21:02.270
I should save some room.

21:02.270 --> 21:05.200
We've got a whole day of
pig feast coming up tomorrow.

21:10.750 --> 21:11.550
What's wrong?

21:11.720 --> 21:13.640
Bro, what is that?

21:13.720 --> 21:14.790
You've had too much to drink, haven't you?

21:14.790 --> 21:17.780
Those who have innocent blood
on their hands,

21:17.830 --> 21:20.690
vengeful spirits have come to
claim your lives!

21:27.680 --> 21:30.250
You've harmed too many innocent lives.

21:30.320 --> 21:31.920
Follow me to the underworld today

21:31.920 --> 21:33.520
to pay for your bloody debts!

21:47.640 --> 21:49.500
Xiao Yao's method really works.

21:57.200 --> 21:58.380
I've come to save you.

21:58.380 --> 21:59.580
Come with me quickly.

22:04.750 --> 22:06.260
Are you hurt?

22:07.590 --> 22:08.560
Got you!

22:08.720 --> 22:10.740
You stupid pig, you fell for it!

22:32.270 --> 22:34.470
The Feiyu Guards' method really works.

22:36.270 --> 22:37.630
Another pig.

22:37.880 --> 22:39.820
Birds of a feather
really do flock together.

22:39.820 --> 22:42.460
Let's see what kind of creature
comes next.

22:44.790 --> 22:45.920
Come on, grunt for us.

22:45.920 --> 22:47.340
One, two, three, four.

22:48.070 --> 22:49.440
This is the perfect chance

22:49.440 --> 22:51.030
to see if my skills

22:51.030 --> 22:52.430
have improved recently.

22:53.550 --> 22:54.810
Another demon is here.

22:55.960 --> 22:57.350
Here comes another one.

22:59.200 --> 23:01.120
I'm your demon nightmare!

23:04.920 --> 23:05.810
Xiao Yao!

23:07.070 --> 23:08.480
Xiao Yao!

23:18.270 --> 23:19.160
Xiao Yao!

23:19.160 --> 23:20.220
Let's go. Let's go.

23:20.310 --> 23:21.840
Let's get out of here first.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.980
Tonight's haul is good.

23:33.680 --> 23:36.320
This is already the second one.

23:37.240 --> 23:38.070
If we're really going to be braised,

23:38.070 --> 23:39.160
just leave me behind.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.270
That's not for you to decide.

23:40.270 --> 23:40.940
Move aside.

23:46.830 --> 23:48.190
Mere parlor tricks.

23:48.590 --> 23:49.050
Attack!

23:49.400 --> 23:51.130
Run! Come on, run for your life!

23:56.310 --> 23:57.480
Cover your mouths and noses!

23:57.480 --> 23:59.140
A great demon might be coming!

24:21.960 --> 24:22.840
My Lord!

24:23.350 --> 24:25.210
Our Demon King has come to save us!

24:26.680 --> 24:28.060
Since you know who I am,

24:28.680 --> 24:30.800
there's no need to resist further.

24:31.940 --> 24:33.670
Today is the Lantern Festival.

24:34.160 --> 24:36.590
I don't wish to start a massacre.

24:46.040 --> 24:46.660
Let's go.

25:03.970 --> 25:06.030
Your power has really been restored?

25:07.810 --> 25:09.910
Fire! Fire!

25:10.720 --> 25:12.660
-Fire!
-Come on, run!

25:13.790 --> 25:16.070
Fire!

25:37.720 --> 25:38.830
It's lamp oil.

25:39.960 --> 25:42.200
That one just now
wasn't the Demon King at all.

25:42.200 --> 25:42.800
After him!

25:44.400 --> 25:45.880
-Don't let him escape!
-This way!

25:45.880 --> 25:46.550
After him!

25:48.110 --> 25:49.630
Hurry! Keep up! This way!

25:49.720 --> 25:50.380
After them!

25:50.720 --> 25:51.380
After them!

25:51.640 --> 25:52.970
Don't let them get away!

25:54.240 --> 25:55.040
Nothing here!

25:55.410 --> 25:56.410
Where did they go?

25:56.510 --> 25:57.170
Over there!

25:57.640 --> 25:58.300
After them!

25:58.920 --> 25:59.400
Luoluo.

26:00.070 --> 26:01.410
How did you end up here?

26:11.000 --> 26:11.830
What's wrong?

26:12.590 --> 26:13.510
My Lord.

26:14.270 --> 26:15.200
Xiao Yao.

26:16.880 --> 26:18.840
You're finally back.

26:20.160 --> 26:20.920
But why...

26:21.270 --> 26:21.680
Why...

26:21.790 --> 26:23.910
Why did it take you so long?

26:23.940 --> 26:25.000
Demons' Valley...

26:25.510 --> 26:26.570
Demons' Valley...

26:26.830 --> 26:28.690
What happened to Demons' Valley?

26:29.720 --> 26:31.720
Xiao Yao, shortly after you left,

26:31.830 --> 26:33.030
Heiwu led Wu Huan

26:33.030 --> 26:34.640
in a surprise attack on
Xiao Ming and Xiao Mu.

26:34.640 --> 26:36.160
Xiao Ming and Xiao Mu were badly injured,

26:36.160 --> 26:38.360
and we still don't know where they went.

26:38.480 --> 26:39.340
Just like that,

26:39.680 --> 26:42.170
Demons' Valley fell under Heiwu's control.

26:43.030 --> 26:44.330
He also claimed that you were dead,
My Lord,

26:44.330 --> 26:46.720
and that all demons
must obey him from then on.

26:46.720 --> 26:48.480
He completely removed
Demons' Valley's barrier

26:48.480 --> 26:49.960
and let the Feiyu Guards in.

26:49.960 --> 26:52.790
On the 1st and 15th of each month
in the human calendar,

26:52.790 --> 26:54.620
he forces us demons to draw lots.

26:55.480 --> 26:56.480
Those who are chosen

26:56.480 --> 27:00.030
are sent with the Feiyu Guards
as offerings to the human emperor.

27:00.030 --> 27:02.830
Now everyone in the valley
lives in constant fear,

27:03.070 --> 27:05.370
not knowing who will be next.

27:06.590 --> 27:08.160
I was so terrified

27:08.160 --> 27:09.880
that I escaped.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.680
It's all my fault.

27:15.160 --> 27:17.620
If I had known,
before I left Demons' Valley,

27:17.750 --> 27:19.280
I should have killed Heiwu.

27:21.720 --> 27:24.120
I originally thought he was merely greedy,

27:24.790 --> 27:25.960
but I never imagined

27:26.440 --> 27:28.680
he would dare to collude with
the Feiyu Guards

27:28.680 --> 27:29.790
to harm his own kind

27:30.860 --> 27:32.840
and commit such cruel acts.

27:34.910 --> 27:36.840
Now that you've returned, My Lord,

27:37.110 --> 27:40.310
please stand up for us
and help us reclaim Demons' Valley.

27:46.050 --> 27:46.860
Don't worry.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.530
Now that we're back,

27:48.640 --> 27:51.550
we'll definitely teach
the Feiyu Guards and Heiwu a lesson.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.160
But

27:52.830 --> 27:54.380
we'll need to
think this through carefully.

27:54.380 --> 27:55.750
Tonight is the 15th.

27:56.030 --> 27:57.680
In another 15 days,
it will be the 1st again.

27:57.680 --> 28:00.680
H-How can we possibly have time
to think this through?

28:06.030 --> 28:07.430
Have a drink for courage,

28:07.720 --> 28:10.080
and we'll fight our way back to
Demons' Valley.

28:10.080 --> 28:11.530
I like the sound of that.

28:14.640 --> 28:15.170
Alright.

28:30.640 --> 28:33.200
♪ The Three-Life Stone cracks,
unleashing the light of three lifetimes ♪

28:34.450 --> 28:36.950
♪ Shattering the window of
the mortal world ♪

28:38.040 --> 28:40.580
♪ The unity knot loosens,
unlocking the lock of togetherness ♪

28:41.980 --> 28:43.420
♪ Tasting the scalding flow of life ♪

28:44.630 --> 28:47.690
♪ Moss traces creep along
the corridor of reincarnation ♪

28:49.060 --> 28:50.360
♪ The door ring echoes ♪

28:51.850 --> 28:53.000
♪ The River of Forgetfulness
flows backward ♪

28:54.020 --> 28:57.300
♪ Streaming across your eyes ♪

28:58.650 --> 29:00.570
♪ The tides push the waves ♪

29:01.510 --> 29:02.650
♪ The rings of years keep growing ♪

29:03.550 --> 29:05.040
♪ The heart knocks with
the weight of time ♪

29:04.440 --> 29:05.830
This trip to Demons' Valley

29:05.830 --> 29:07.400
♪ The hair starts to turn grey  ♪

29:06.480 --> 29:08.140
will be extremely dangerous.

29:08.520 --> 29:11.680
♪ Frost forms on the brow bones ♪

29:09.790 --> 29:11.720
It's my duty as the Demon King.

29:13.560 --> 29:17.170
♪ Flames of the burning heart
cook the fragrance of a bygone world ♪

29:14.790 --> 29:16.590
Since I cannot protect you,

29:17.870 --> 29:19.860
♪ Dreams break like begonia blossoms ♪

29:18.030 --> 29:20.160
I can only cherish every moment we had.

29:20.710 --> 29:22.650
♪ Rising against the torrent ♪

29:20.910 --> 29:23.370
You're free to live as you please
from now on.

29:23.530 --> 29:26.720
♪ Turning the account of impermanence ♪

29:25.830 --> 29:27.440
I suppose in the human realm,

29:28.310 --> 29:29.920
you'll have a better life.

29:55.790 --> 29:56.350
Let's go.

29:57.730 --> 29:58.230
Let's.

30:00.200 --> 30:00.750
My Lord.

30:01.880 --> 30:03.920
Demons' Valley is
over 1,000 miles from here.

30:03.920 --> 30:05.300
A-Aren't we going to fly there?

30:05.300 --> 30:07.320
I have other important matters
to attend to on the way. Let's go.

30:07.320 --> 30:09.440
B-But yesterday was the 15th.

30:09.830 --> 30:10.920
If we go on foot,

30:10.920 --> 30:12.550
we won't reach Demons' Valley
even in another 15 days.

30:12.550 --> 30:13.410
Then we'll run.

30:13.620 --> 30:14.880
We just need to hurry.

30:15.270 --> 30:15.920
What about Xiao Yao?

30:15.920 --> 30:16.980
No more questions.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.970
But how long will it take
if we run there...

30:33.240 --> 30:35.440
Our promised day off is canceled again.

30:36.550 --> 30:37.880
Wasn't the head of the Feiyu Guards

30:37.880 --> 30:39.080
arrested on the spot?

30:39.480 --> 30:40.920
Why didn't they kill him right there?

30:40.920 --> 30:42.920
Would've saved us all this trouble.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.060
Just hang in there.

30:44.070 --> 30:45.350
Once he's executed tomorrow,

30:45.350 --> 30:46.440
things will quiet down.

30:46.440 --> 30:48.200
Good thing he doesn't have
any close family.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.880
Otherwise, for the crime of
deceiving His Majesty,

30:49.880 --> 30:51.590
his entire clan would be executed.

30:51.590 --> 30:53.400
Just the beheadings alone
would take quite a while.

30:53.400 --> 30:54.400
Didn't they say

30:54.590 --> 30:57.070
he embezzled His Majesty's
Yuli Spring water?

30:57.070 --> 30:59.540
If this Yuli Spring water
really grants immortality,

30:59.540 --> 31:00.350
will they even be able to

31:00.350 --> 31:01.810
cut his head off tomorrow?

31:02.200 --> 31:04.790
Immortality doesn't mean
he has a head made of iron, okay?

31:04.790 --> 31:05.830
Then do you think

31:05.920 --> 31:07.270
once his head is cut off,

31:07.270 --> 31:09.000
a new one will grow in its place?

31:15.880 --> 31:16.960
You must help me.

31:18.190 --> 31:19.940
The criminal, Bingzhu,

31:20.080 --> 31:22.920
used his position as Demon Slayer
of the Feiyu Guards

31:22.920 --> 31:25.040
to collude with Demon King Hong Ye,

31:25.590 --> 31:27.630
sacrificing innocent lives

31:27.830 --> 31:29.550
in exchange for demonic patronage,

31:29.550 --> 31:31.400
fraudulently obtaining court salary

31:31.400 --> 31:33.030
and royal rewards.

31:34.720 --> 31:37.520
His Majesty received guidance
from the Immortal,

31:37.910 --> 31:39.840
which only fueled Bingzhu's greed

31:40.240 --> 31:41.590
even further—

31:42.070 --> 31:43.640
he embezzled the spring water

31:43.640 --> 31:46.650
and harmed the daughters of
100 high-ranking court officials.

31:46.650 --> 31:49.680
His treasonous intentions
were clear as day.

31:56.000 --> 31:58.550
Today, he entered the palace
to see His Majesty

31:58.550 --> 32:00.000
only to assassinate him.

32:01.000 --> 32:02.750
Fortunately, His Majesty
saw through his plan,

32:02.750 --> 32:05.570
and the Feiyu Guards protected
His Majesty with all their might.

32:05.570 --> 32:07.500
With multiple witnesses present,

32:07.920 --> 32:09.120
he finally confessed

32:09.510 --> 32:10.840
to all these evil deeds.

32:15.920 --> 32:17.180
As former colleagues,

32:20.590 --> 32:22.390
there's not much I can do for you.

32:26.830 --> 32:28.160
This is the best I can do.

32:28.640 --> 32:30.440
As long as you sign these charges

32:30.790 --> 32:32.590
and put your thumbprint on them,

32:32.790 --> 32:34.240
I won't subject you to further torture.

32:34.240 --> 32:35.100
What do you say?

32:36.030 --> 32:38.110
Why should I confess to

32:40.400 --> 32:42.310
things I never did?

32:42.480 --> 32:43.590
Lord Bingzhu.

32:43.590 --> 32:45.110
You've been devoted to
protecting the people,

32:45.110 --> 32:47.110
b-but that should be
His Majesty's concern.

32:47.110 --> 32:49.510
Your colleagues here are human too,
just like the common people.

32:49.510 --> 32:51.240
Have you ever thought about us?

32:52.070 --> 32:53.200
You've protected the people for years,

32:53.200 --> 32:55.000
but do you even know their names?

32:55.790 --> 32:57.750
Look at your colleagues around you,

32:57.750 --> 32:59.310
and your sister Tan'er—

33:00.590 --> 33:02.680
which one of them
have you managed to protect?

33:02.680 --> 33:04.350
This is your only chance

33:04.350 --> 33:06.030
to do something for us.

33:07.880 --> 33:10.350
We'll all remember your great kindness,

33:11.110 --> 33:12.910
and it wouldn't be in vain that we

33:13.790 --> 33:15.590
risked our lives alongside you.

33:19.550 --> 33:21.720
The predecessors of the Feiyu Guards

33:23.240 --> 33:24.970
paved the way with their blood,

33:26.730 --> 33:28.560
yet now you all

33:29.240 --> 33:31.440
greedily take bribes and abuse the law,

33:31.750 --> 33:34.030
persecuting the loyal and upright.

33:36.640 --> 33:38.880
How truly pitiful.

33:47.000 --> 33:48.600
So you refuse to sign, right?

33:48.680 --> 33:49.410
That's fine.

33:54.070 --> 33:57.200
His Majesty only said to
keep you alive until execution,

33:57.400 --> 33:59.730
but he didn't say
you had to remain intact.

34:02.240 --> 34:03.900
If I cut off this hand of yours,

34:03.920 --> 34:05.510
I can use it to sign

34:05.790 --> 34:07.190
as many charges as I want.

34:12.590 --> 34:13.120
Someone!

34:13.510 --> 34:14.030
Yes!

34:15.480 --> 34:16.000
Do it.

34:22.500 --> 34:23.070
My Lord,

34:23.960 --> 34:24.920
we also have

34:25.340 --> 34:26.320
no other option.

34:29.630 --> 34:31.760
Someone's attempting a prison break!

36:08.030 --> 36:09.180
Let me go!

36:13.960 --> 36:16.690
Bingzhu risked his life
for the imperial orders,

36:17.280 --> 36:19.610
yet you framed him
and put him in death row.

36:20.440 --> 36:21.510
You Feiyu Guards,

36:21.920 --> 36:23.320
each and every one of you,

36:23.360 --> 36:25.290
have you all lost your conscience?

36:25.690 --> 36:27.020
You insolent demoness.

36:27.630 --> 36:28.760
Form the formation!

36:29.800 --> 36:30.420
My Lord.

36:30.510 --> 36:31.300
She's human.

36:31.510 --> 36:33.570
I'm afraid the formation won't work.

36:33.840 --> 36:34.840
Then why waste words?

36:34.840 --> 36:35.360
Attack together!

36:35.360 --> 36:35.750
Yes!

36:35.840 --> 36:36.300
Attack!

36:59.920 --> 37:00.850
Tan'er,

37:01.280 --> 37:02.510
if you don't help now,

37:02.840 --> 37:04.440
we'll all die here today!

37:07.320 --> 37:08.110
Tan'er!

37:08.920 --> 37:11.150
Tan'er, protect Pianpian!

37:12.630 --> 37:13.650
Tan'er!

37:44.710 --> 37:46.440
Everyone, no need to be afraid!

37:47.150 --> 37:48.230
Her demon-slaying blade

37:48.230 --> 37:49.400
can only kill demons.

37:49.400 --> 37:50.300
It can't harm us.

37:50.300 --> 37:52.440
We just need to
block the cell door tightly

37:52.440 --> 37:54.320
so she can't get near Bingzhu.

38:08.690 --> 38:09.580
Tan'er!

38:10.070 --> 38:11.860
Take Pianpian out of here!

38:12.710 --> 38:13.790
Hurry up and leave!

38:31.710 --> 38:32.280
Feiyu Guards!

38:32.280 --> 38:32.960
Yes!

38:33.190 --> 38:34.880
No one is allowed to sleep tonight!

38:34.880 --> 38:36.940
Bring all the Feiyu Guards in the city

38:37.030 --> 38:38.920
and spare no effort to hunt down
that demoness who broke into prison!

38:38.920 --> 38:41.030
We must not let her disturb His Majesty

38:41.030 --> 38:42.230
during the execution tomorrow!

38:42.230 --> 38:43.000
Yes!

38:43.400 --> 38:44.030
Hurry!

39:38.220 --> 39:39.880
It's already the fifth watch.

39:41.030 --> 39:43.490
Are there any ways left
to save your brother?

40:52.510 --> 40:54.110
How beautiful.

41:08.000 --> 41:09.400
Without a sincere heart,

41:10.280 --> 41:11.550
one's fate is sealed.

41:13.320 --> 41:15.190
Is that the Exalted Immortal?

41:20.800 --> 41:22.930
You're not destined for immortality.

41:23.000 --> 41:24.590
It's all just a fleeting dream in the end.
